liquid crystal display device with a touch panel comprising, arranged in the order mentioned starting at a display surface side, a polarizing plate (11), a quarter-wave plate (12), a touch panel (19), a quarter-wave plate (16) and a liquid crystal cell (18), wherein the polarization axis of the polarizing plate (11) and the lagging axis in the film plane of the quarter-wave plate (12) are disposed so as to form substantially 45 DEG  between them, the lagging axis in the film plane of the quarter-wave plate (16) and the polarization axis of an outgoing light from the liquid crystal cell (18) are disposed so as to form substantially 45 DEG  between them, and the lagging axes of the quarter-wave plates (12, 16) are in parallel to each other or not orthogonal to each other.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif d'affichage à cristaux liquides à écran tactile qui comprend, placé dans l'ordre mentionné et à partir du côté surface d'affichage, une plaque (11) polarisante, une plaque (12) quart-d'onde, un écran (19) tactile, une plaque (16) quart-d'onde et une cellule (18) de cristaux liquides. L'axe de polarisation de la plaque (11) polarisante et l'axe de retard de phase situé dans le plan de film de la plaque (12) quart-d'onde sont placés de manière à former sensiblement un angle de 45 DEG . L'axe de retard de phase situé dans le plan de film de la plaque (16) quart-d'onde et l'axe de polarisation de la lumière sortant de la cellule (18) de cristaux liquides sont placés de manière à former sensiblement un angle de 45 DEG , et les axes de retard de phase des plaques (12, 16) quart-d'onde sont parallèles ou non orthogonaux.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including